msgstr "Pending changes in other settings were found. Apply or discard them before saving this setup."

msgid "Pending changes to this limiter were found. Apply or discard them before starting the wizard."
msgstr "Pending changes to this limiter were found. Apply or discard them before starting the wizard."

msgid "No changes have been saved yet."
msgstr "No changes have been saved yet."

msgid "Reconnect cooldown (seconds)"
msgstr "Reconnect cooldown (seconds)"

msgid "0 = no pause. After a disconnect, block automatic and manual reconnections on all selected WiFi networks for this duration."
msgstr "0 = no pause. After a disconnect, block automatic and manual reconnections on all selected WiFi networks for this duration."

msgid "Reconnect protection window (seconds)"
msgstr "Reconnect protection window (seconds)"

msgid "0 = disabled. For this long after a disconnect, returning devices may rejoin only if guest slots are free and the reconnect cooldown has ended."
msgstr "0 = disabled. For this long after a disconnect, returning devices may rejoin only if guest slots are free and the reconnect cooldown has ended."

msgid "Allow guests to access the Internet"
msgstr "Allow guests to access the Internet"

msgid "When disabled, guests can reach the local WiFi network only. Protected devices keep their existing Internet access. Test mode logs the policy without applying it."
msgstr "When disabled, guests can reach the local WiFi network only. Protected devices keep their existing Internet access. Test mode logs the policy without applying it."

